==Trivia==
*Lumina bears a resemblance to the Lake Guardians from ''Pokémon'': [[bulbapedia:Uxie (Pokémon)|Uxie]], [[bulbapedia:Azelf (Pokémon)|Azelf]] and [[bulbapedia:Mesprit (Pokémon)|Mesprit]] mainly due to the similar tails (and the fact that they are all fairy-like creatures). Thus, Lumina is likely meant to represent the Psychic type in Pokemon.

